sequenceDiagram
 actor Moderator
 participant Admin as SQLAdmin
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 participant Parser as Telethon Parser
 participant TG as Telegram MTProto
 participant Store as MinIO
 participant Worker
 participant LLM as Внешняя LLM
 Moderator->>Admin: Запустить источник
 Admin->>DB: Создать parser_run
 Parser->>DB: Claim run + checkpoint
 Parser->>TG: Первый запуск: 30 дней / далее incremental + окно ревизий
 TG-->>Parser: Сообщения, подписи, медиа, edit timestamps
 Parser->>Store: Оригиналы и медиа
 Parser->>DB: UPSERT (source_id, message_id), revisions
 Parser->>DB: Enqueue extraction jobs
 Worker->>DB: Claim job SKIP LOCKED
 Worker->>LLM: Только текст и подписи
 LLM-->>Worker: Structured extraction
 Worker->>DB: Validate, normalize, candidate + evidence
 Note over Worker,DB: Не публикует; fuzzy duplicates лишь на проверку
